    "sub_name": "不動產爭端分析與協商機制",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE DISPUTES HANDLING",
    "describe_ch": "面對現今多元不動產市場中的諸多問題及處理機制，如何有效藉由系統性、結構化的處理程序、協商機制，快速透過談判技巧、要領或策略，有效化解爭端，排除困難，尋得合作，爭取商機。",
    "describe_eh": "In the face of many problems and handling mechanisms in the market of diversified real estate, how to effectively resolve disputes, eliminate difficulties and find cooperation through systematic, structured procedures and consultation mechanisms. Quickly through negotiation skills, essentials or strategies, Fight for business opportunities.",
